  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.gale_otaijutsu.detail.2": "Hits grant Speed, Haste and Resistance while slowing the target.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.gale_otaijutsu.detail.3": "Use on a block to leap upward in the direction of your gaze.",
