  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.rotten_blade.detail.2": "Normal use empowers you and harms recorded targets, but causes backlash.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.rotten_blade.detail.3": "Sneak-use damages a large area and applies Wither and Slowness.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.rotten_blade.detail.4": "The area ability also poisons and slows its wielder.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.judgement.summary": "Rejects one incoming hit before it takes hold",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.judgement.detail.1": "Wear in the necklace slot; when ready, the next hit is fully negated.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.judgement.detail.2": "Activation grants invulnerability, with cooldown starting on the blocked hit.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.light_forged_halo.summary": "Calls down a Light Staff through a radiant forged halo",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.light_forged_halo.detail.1": "Worn on the back, it increases attack damage and attack speed.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.light_forged_halo.detail.2": "Eligible damage summons a Light Staff when either combatant is bright enough.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.light_forged_halo.detail.3": "Impact deals direct damage, then area damage to nearby non-allies.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.light_forged_halo.detail.4": "Light damage is data-tagged and bypasses hurt invulnerability.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.dark_forged_halo.summary": "Curses attackers that strike within darkness",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.dark_forged_halo.detail.1": "Worn on the back, it raises maximum health and armor and refreshes Night Vision.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.dark_forged_halo.detail.2": "Eligible damage curses its source when either participant is dark enough.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.dark_forged_halo.detail.3": "The curse draws distinct random harmful effects from a data tag.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.dark_forged_halo.detail.4": "Damage dealt to a marked target heals the player who marked it.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.dark_forged_halo.detail.5": "Sourceless damage applies no curse and instead restores part of that damage.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.void_ring.summary": "Slips into imaginary space just before death",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.void_ring.detail.1": "Wear in a ring slot; when ready, death is canceled and vital needs are restored.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.void_ring.detail.2": "Activation clears every status effect and temporarily forces Spectator mode.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.void_ring.detail.3": "The original game mode persists and restores correctly after travel or reconnecting.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.void_ring.detail.4": "When configured, wearing it bypasses both forged halo brightness conditions.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.rain_crystal.summary": "Consumes itself to call down rain",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.rain_crystal.detail.1": "Use to immediately set the current world's weather to rain.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.rain_crystal.detail.2": "Each use consumes one crystal and applies an item cooldown.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.sun_crystal.summary": "Consumes itself to clear the rain",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.sun_crystal.detail.1": "Use to immediately clear rain from the current world.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.sun_crystal.detail.2": "Each use consumes one crystal and resets the weather timer.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.echo_activator.summary": "Awakens a Sculk Shrieker's summoning potential",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.echo_activator.detail.1": "Use on a Sculk Shrieker to make it capable of summoning a Warden.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.echo_activator.detail.2": "Using it on Cake replaces the block with an active Sculk Shrieker.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.nano_machine.summary": "Rewrites an offhand item or reinforces its user",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.nano_machine.detail.1": "Use in the main hand to convert a supported offhand item into an unbreakable form.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.nano_machine.detail.2": "Finish using it from the offhand to consume it and gain many effects.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.nano_machine.detail.3": "Short effects include powerful Absorption and Regeneration.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.nano_machine.detail.4": "Long effects include Resistance, Strength, Fire Resistance, Water Breathing, Speed and Jump Boost.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.position_selector.summary": "Records a block position for remote machine targeting",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.position_selector.detail.1": "Use on a block to write its coordinates into the item data.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.position_selector.detail.2": "Stored coordinates and the current block there remain visible below.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.rock_solid.summary": "Trades mobility for brief, solid protection",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.rock_solid.detail.1": "Use to gain Absorption and Resistance while suffering Slowness.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.rock_solid.detail.2": "Activation places both Rock Solid and Indestructible on their cooldowns.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.indestructible.summary": "Trades mobility for stronger short-term protection",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.indestructible.detail.1": "Use to gain powerful Absorption and Resistance while suffering Slowness.",
  "tooltip.dustandash.gear.indestructible.detail.2": "Activation places both Indestructible and Rock Solid on their cooldowns.",

